# public/extension/ is deliberately NOT ignored: unlike the sitemap (prebuild
# regenerates it every build), nothing on CI re-packages the extension — a
# git-connected deploy ships only what is committed, so the packaged artifacts
# must be committed to distribute at /extension.
# Stryker mutation-testing artifacts (path-3 runs): the numbers file to the
# thread; the raw report + sandbox are per-run machine output.
reports/mutation/
.stryker-tmp/
.shadow/
